### Before - Quality Mode (no strategy)

Centralized Signal Extraction for Product Initiatives
Sarah, a Senior PM, struggles with remembering the 'why' behind product decisions due to scattered information across Notion, Zendesk, and emails. She needs a single platform to aggregate transcripts, tickets, and emails to extract the core 'signal' – identifying user pain points, their severity, and shaping defensible opportunity briefs.

“The hardest part isn't deciding what to build; it's remembering why we decided it.”
“Interview notes live in Notion, support tickets in Zendesk, and exec feedback arrives as forwarded emails.”
“By the time I write the PRD, I've opened 40 tabs and still can't find the original quote.”
“What I need is a single place where I paste everything—transcripts, tickets, emails—and get back the actual signal: who feels the pain, how strong is it, and what a defensible opportunity brief would look like.”
